## Executive Summary

Urban Merchants, Inc. (UMI), a retail and e-commerce company originally based in Chicago, Illinois, has recently undergone significant changes that have impacted its operational landscape. This document details the current state of UMI’s store performance, e-commerce efficiency, employee turnover, and customer satisfaction metrics, providing a contrasting view and raising concerns over operational viability and strategic direction heading into the next quarter.

